ll,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["第Ｎ次回訪，每次必點牛骨拉麵\n也帶了好多朋友造訪，人人都說讚\n上次去吃的時候上菜準備開動馬上看見了一根短短的毛髮\n本來想說反應一下請廚師注意就好\n但店家超積極處理+道歉，不只馬上重做一碗還只動說退錢\n重新上菜的時候還幫我加了蛋，根本超有誠意\n給四星是因為......上第二碗的時候還是有一根細軟淺毛😂\n但身為I人就默默地拿起來，開動了\n還是會回訪 但上菜前還是多注意一下有沒有其他物質😂\n食物一樣很好吃👍服務也無可挑惕",null,[0,56]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/6954279598648027760/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFzTkUxR1ZYaGtNV3hwVlZkU2JGSlliM2RSVjBwMVRVWm9iRlJWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6954279598648027760/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFzTkUxR1ZYaGtNV3hwVlZkU2JGSlliM2RSVjBwMVRVWm9iRlJWUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/6954279598648027760/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFzTkUxR1ZYaGtNV3hwVlZkU2JGSlliM2RSVjBwMVRVWm9iRlJWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6954279598648027760/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFzTkUxR1ZYaGtNV3hwVlZkU2JGSlliM2RSVjBwMVRVWm9iRlJWUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/6954279598648027760/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFzTkUxR1ZYaGtNV3hwVlZkU2JGSlliM2RSVjBwMVRVWm9iRlJWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6954279598648027760/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFzTkUxR1ZYaGtNV3hwVlZkU2JGSlliM2RSVjBwMVRVWm9iRlJWUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,4725,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21sNE1GVXhkMWxpVVdSbFJYb3dRV0p1TUZobFRVRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xd3780288c1b99726!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOml4MFUxd1liUWRlRXowQWJuMFhlTUE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21sNE1GVXhkMWxpVVdSbFJYb3dRV0p1TUZobFRVRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21sNE1GVXhkMWxpVVdSbFJYb3dRV0p1TUZobFRVRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21sNE1GVXhkMWxpVVdSbFJYb3dRV0p1TUZobFRVRRILMGR